 the player across.\n\nReason: Aiming for a Half Flush or Full Flush in Characters ensures the hand meets the 8-point minimum (6 for Half Flush + 2 for Concealed Kong). Discarding the Dot tiles is necessary for this strategy. B7 is chosen over B8 as it is a safer tile to discard, having been previously played by an opponent.\n\nAnswer: Play B7"}
